@startuml
title Hannibal v0.5 — Time-bounded containment decision
participant "Trusted Ingestor" as I
participant "Detection" as D
participant "Threat Graph" as G
participant "Overwatch" as O
participant "Policy Verifier" as P
participant "Containment Broker" as B
database "Audit Journal" as J
I -> D: Verified raw event + root ID
D -> G: Derived finding + same root ID
D -> O: Verified behavior finding
G -> O: Path hypothesis (same root)
O -> O: Cannot count graph finding as second observation
O -> J: Record triage + insufficient corroboration
... Independent confirmed observation arrives ...
I -> O: Second raw event with distinct root + channel
O -> P: Check freshness, calibration, protection, policy
alt any check fails
  P --> O: Deny / alert
  O -> J: reason and missing preconditions
else policy may permit
  P --> O: Authorized action candidate
  O -> B: action request, expiry, target key
  B -> B: Independently revalidate policy, trusted event roots,\nexact identity, system exclusions, idempotency
  alt broker verification fails
    B --> O: deny receipt
  else verified
    B --> O: receipt with rollback token
  end
  O -> J: decision, broker outcome and evidence roots
end
@enduml
